Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.09,0:00:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glorious fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.55,0:00:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a natural emotion\Npresent in all animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.07,0:00:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.15,0:00:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what do you think causes fear?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.59,0:00:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is the kind of fear\Nborn of animal instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.99,0:00:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the kind of fear born of a\Nrational mind that terrorizes humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.63,0:00:29.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Namely, when you encounter a\Nfoe stronger than yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.75,0:00:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And realize you have no way of\Nfighting back against the unknown!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.55,0:00:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your helplessness begins to sink in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.99,0:00:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and evokes inside of you a\Nterrible and paralyzing fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.15,0:00:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you are faced with such fear,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.61,0:00:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you have a number of options\Nbefore you from which to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.93,0:00:59.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might struggle, resist,\Nflee, accept, or freeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.77,0:01:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But upon meeting Lord Dio, a\Nnew unexpected reaction arises.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.57,0:01:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You feel joy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.11,0:01:12.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you think most people\Nact once they feel joy and fear?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.55,0:01:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an interesting experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.15,0:01:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our friend is currently on the plane\Nthat Joestar and the others have boarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.11,0:01:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll greet them accordingly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.27,0:01:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they will find it\Nutterly impossible to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.91,0:01:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reach their final\Ndestination in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.31,0:02:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A rhino beetle?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.73,0:02:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's a stag beetle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.03,0:02:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Avdol, is that a stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.45,0:02:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we already encountering\Nanother stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.23,0:02:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.29,0:02:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This could be a stem that takes\Nthe shape of an insect. What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.91,0:02:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hid in the shadow of the seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.43,0:02:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.57,0:02:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could be anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.69,0:02:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.60,0:02:36.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's next to your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.59,0:02:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look to your right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.87,0:02:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.77,0:03:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.79,0:03:46.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.63,0:03:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.29,0:03:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to go!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.49,0:04:12.46,Title 3,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,475)\pos(192,825)}Episode 4: Tower of Gray
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.29,0:04:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sit tight. I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.21,0:04:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be extremely careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.09,0:04:25.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard that there is\Na user of an insect stand
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.67,0:04:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that likes to rip out the\Ntongues of his victims?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.49,0:04:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before they die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.11,0:04:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.01,0:04:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It dodged you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.97,0:04:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.11,0:04:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's faster than Star Platinum, a\Nstand that has the speed and precision.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.61,0:04:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to grab a flying bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.33,0:04:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then there's no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.23,0:04:47.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bug can only be a stand. Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.17,0:04:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.77,0:04:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the one who's controlling it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.47,0:04:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.17,0:04:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's getting ready to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.67,0:04:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.35,0:05:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.31,0:05:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum stopped it with its\Nteeth just in the nick of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.07,0:05:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as I feared.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.43,0:05:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going after Jotaro's Stan's tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.95,0:05:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.05,0:05:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Represented by the\NTower Card of the Tarot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.11,0:05:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Symbolizing Calamity and the interruption\Nof a journey, this stand is called...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.79,0:05:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tower of Grey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.45,0:05:34.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tower of Grey is responsible\Nfor countless mass murders,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.51,0:05:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which he made to look like\Nunfortunate accidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.91,0:05:39.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The plane crash last year in England that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.25,0:05:41.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,caused over 300 deaths\Nwas likely his work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.85,0:05:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how many more have\Nthere been over the years?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.33,0:05:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd heard rumors, but to\Nthink he's teamed up with Dio!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.49,0:05:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.65,0:05:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.21,0:05:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It dodged that attack too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.21,0:05:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not just from the single hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.89,0:06:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it also dodged a\Ntwo-fisted barrage of blows!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.61,0:06:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.65,0:06:10.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you had ten guns to shoot\Nbullets from one centimeter away,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.55,0:06:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they would not be able to touch my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.01,0:06:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that you could kill a\Nstand with a gun anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.39,0:06:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all going to die with\Nthe rest of these Wheatlings!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.41,0:06:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has to be on this plane with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.43,0:06:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.77,0:06:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is the one controlling the stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.41,0:06:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one of the passengers is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.21,0:06:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can track him\Ndown, we can squash him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.75,0:06:39.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He disappeared again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.79,0:06:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heads up! It's over there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.91,0:06:52.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's it planning to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.49,0:06:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No it can't be.
