Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.03,0:07:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bingo got their tongues\Nnow for the best part.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.27,0:07:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Massacre!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.49,0:07:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its definition?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.89,0:07:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To kill everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.67,0:07:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it actually did it! Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.05,0:07:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll burn that damn bug alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.49,0:07:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go Magicians Red!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.89,0:07:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.01,0:07:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hold on a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.91,0:07:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so damn noisy on this flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.93,0:07:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with all the ruckus? Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.77,0:07:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might as well go to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.27,0:07:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is this wet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.61,0:07:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with all this slimy stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.75,0:07:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.45,0:08:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.51,0:08:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.31,0:08:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Atum!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.57,0:08:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to defeat it before the\Nother passengers start to panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.09,0:08:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easier said than done, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.45,0:08:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Avdol,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.36,0:08:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,using an active stand\Nlike your magician's red
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.51,0:08:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,inside an airborne plane\Ncould make it explode,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.19,0:08:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,killing all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.21,0:08:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, if your power were to rip a hole\Nin the fuselage, it'd be a catastrophe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.75,0:08:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This calls for a quiet and discreet stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.15,0:08:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hierophant green is most\Nsuited to defeating it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.09,0:08:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me take care of the pest control.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.29,0:08:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard all about you from Lord Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.91,0:08:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.89,0:08:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you have silence on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.25,0:08:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your stand cannot\Nkeep up with my speed.
