Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.51,0:08:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emerald Splash! Splash!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.37,0:09:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emerald splash again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.05,0:09:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem to think you can hit\Nme if you fire enough shots,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.27,0:09:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you haven't hit me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.15,0:09:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.33,0:09:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's dodging everything he throws at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.55,0:09:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.27,0:09:26.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just too fast for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.05,0:09:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're way too slow to get a bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.85,0:09:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Kakyoin,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.29,0:09:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with my next attack, I'll stab your\NStan's tongue with this tower needle?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.19,0:09:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and rip it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.41,0:09:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't that be fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.03,0:09:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emerald Splash!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.59,0:09:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.93,0:09:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.51,0:09:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can he win if his attacks\Ndon't find their mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.07,0:09:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll go mad from the pain\Nonce this rips its tongue out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.81,0:09:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How exquisite!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.89,0:09:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sad right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.95,0:10:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If its tongue's ripped out,\NI'll go mad from the pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.43,0:10:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hierophant green\Nwill go mad, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.41,0:10:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.57,0:10:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it rips you apart, it'll go mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.63,0:10:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From pure joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.99,0:10:25.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His appendages had already\Nslipped beneath the seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.85,0:10:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just needed enough time\Nto set up my little trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.27,0:10:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't realize I was using my\Nemerald splash to keep you in one spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.15,0:10:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.87,0:10:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that geezer was the\Nuser all along, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.49,0:10:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, guess I should have expected as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.21,0:10:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A repulsive stand usually\Nhas a repulsive user.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.35,0:11:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.75,0:11:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like he had\NDio's flesh bud in his forehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.77,0:11:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tower of Grey was always evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.07,0:11:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He killed Turris by the\Nhundreds and got paid for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.15,0:11:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd make it look like an accident\Nand got away with it every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.53,0:11:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Tio was able to use him because\Nhe was easily bought and blinded by greed
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.69,0:11:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.71,0:11:28.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could be my imagination,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.23,0:11:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I get the feeling this plane\Nisn't flying straight anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.95,0:11:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's crooked. No doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.99,0:11:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eh, it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.53,0:11:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sir, you can't be up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.47,0:11:49.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cockpit is up ahead, so\Npassengers may not enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.31,0:11:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.23,0:11:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.13,0:12:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so handsome!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.35,0:12:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.55,0:12:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.35,0:12:08.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa there. Sorry, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.85,0:12:12.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His disrespectful behavior\Ntowards you two is incorrigible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.19,0:12:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we have an emergency on our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.53,0:12:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive him for me? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.39,0:12:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.13,0:12:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is horrible.
