Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.13,0:12:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Stand at the Tower card would signify\Nhorrible accidents and the end of journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.01,0:13:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep you from Lord Dio\Nif it's the last thing I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.35,0:13:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you manage to survive the crash,\Nyou're still 10,000 kilometers from Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.47,0:13:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who swore loyalty to Lord\NDio will pursue you relentlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.35,0:13:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't stand a chance in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.59,0:13:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are stands in this world with powers\Nthat defy the very limits of imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.27,0:13:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Dio's power is the one\Nthat rules over all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.73,0:13:29.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is the master of stands, reigning\Nover the world like a god among mortals.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.89,0:13:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way you'll reach them alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.15,0:13:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastards won't even see Egypt!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.49,0:13:37.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your deaths will be swift and painful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.75,0:13:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're definitely professionals.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.29,0:13:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good thing you didn't scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.07,0:13:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That annoys me all to freaking hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.79,0:13:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I've got a request.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.71,0:13:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This heap's gonna hit water, and\Nthis old man's gonna land her there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.65,0:14:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go put life jackets on the other passengers,\Nand make sure they're buckled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.15,0:14:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.06,0:14:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got this? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.47,0:14:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have some experience with prop\Nplanes, but this... Prop planes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.03,0:14:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Jotaro, this will make\Nthree plane crashes for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.15,0:14:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you ever heard of someone\Nbeing in a plane crash three times?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.97,0:14:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let alone surviving each one?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.75,0:14:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.15,0:14:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm never riding in a\Nplane with you again.
