Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.09,0:14:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The plane landed 35 kilometers\Noff the coast of Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.01,0:14:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro and the others had no\Nchoice but to head to the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.55,0:14:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,South of Hong Kong near Lama Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.85,0:14:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rescue efforts are now underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.83,0:15:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hong Kong!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.15,0:15:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hong Kong Island, Kowloon,\Nthe New Territories.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.61,0:15:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With more than 235 individual\Nislands in the area,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.65,0:15:12.61,Captions 3,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(462,464)\pos(960,855)}— Hong Kong —
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.53,0:15:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,its breathtaking nightscape is known the\Nworld over as the Million Dollar View.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.69,0:15:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.33,0:15:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.71,0:15:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please make sure the only ones\Naboard are us and the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.23,0:15:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.27,0:15:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's been enough collateral\Ndamage because of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.37,0:15:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.99,0:15:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, big guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.11,0:15:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys aren't from around here, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.55,0:15:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want some rice porridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.81,0:15:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't come to Hong Kong and try\Nour rice porridge and dim sum?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.63,0:15:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have some hot cola, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.91,0:15:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rice porridge, not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.29,0:15:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know, Jojo, unlike in Japan, rice\Nporridge is a staple food in Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.07,0:15:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To some, it's quite a delicacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.05,0:15:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One bowl, the popular way with pork\Nand century egg, if you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.95,0:15:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coming right up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.07,0:15:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll have...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.37,0:15:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.28,0:15:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.20,0:15:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You boys think we have time to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.11,0:15:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to my old favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.35,0:16:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can wait to stuff your faces there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.27,0:16:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you dandy guy over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.11,0:16:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you'd be interested in\Nsome Hong Kong hot cola. Hot cola?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.39,0:16:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's blasphemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.57,0:16:10.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows it's supposed to be cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.55,0:16:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man, who were you just calling?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.15,0:16:15.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.25,0:16:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll explain when we\Nget to the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.17,0:16:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.83,0:16:20.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to work out a plan that'll get us
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.89,0:16:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to Egypt as safely and\Nquickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.25,0:16:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More users are bound to come after\Nus, and that could cost lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.35,0:16:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right. A plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.93,0:16:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.27,0:16:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't allow any more innocent civilians\Nto be hurt because of our failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.39,0:16:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The quickest way would be\Nby plane, but that's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.43,0:16:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.34,0:16:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's now become completely\Nimpossible for us to fly to Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.49,0:16:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.47,0:16:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if we encounter a STAN user like\Nthe last one on a commercial flight,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.49,0:16:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll cause a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.17,0:16:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One that will harm many people\Nand might kill many more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.41,0:16:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With that in mind, we'll have to\Nget to Egypt by either land or sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.03,0:17:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear you, but if we fail\Nto find Dio within 50 days…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.59,0:17:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we could have stayed on that plane,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.65,0:17:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'd probably be in Cairo\Nand this would be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.93,0:17:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm well aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.37,0:17:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, it's too soon to worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.41,0:17:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,100 years ago, Jules Verne wrote\NAround the World in 80 Days,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.63,0:17:31.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a story about a man who travels\N40,000 kilometers in 11 weeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.91,0:17:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,using nothing but trains and steamboats.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.43,0:17:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We may not have a plane,\Nbut we still have 50 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.55,0:17:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be able to travel the\N10,000 kilometers to Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.87,0:17:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as for the route we'll take,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.51,0:17:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say, we go by sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.65,0:17:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll charter a suitably sized boat,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.91,0:17:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go around the Malay Peninsula\Nand cross the Indian Ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.07,0:17:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a silk road of the sea, as it were.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.43,0:17:59.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe that is best as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.93,0:18:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crossing by land could be difficult,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.71,0:18:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we'd have to cross the\NHimalayas or the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.05,0:18:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we ran into trouble,\Nwe'd lose a lot of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.53,0:18:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are too many dangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.33,0:18:11.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't been to any of those\Nplaces using either route before,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.57,0:18:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I really don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.07,0:18:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll leave it up to the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.99,0:18:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.51,0:18:18.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it's decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.23,0:18:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.14,0:18:22.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the greatest danger\Nthat we'll face will be
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.17,0:18:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the stand users that Dio sends against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.93,0:18:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have to do our best to get\Nto Egypt without being spotted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.03,0:18:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be so jumpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.49,0:18:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just to let them\Nknow we want more tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.71,0:18:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you do this in Hong Kong, they'll\Nusually bring you more within a few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.07,0:18:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, any time the server\Npours some tea into your cup,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.07,0:18:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tap the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.47,0:18:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a way of saying thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.95,0:19:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.43,0:19:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to be a bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.99,0:19:04.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a tourist from France.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.69,0:19:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you help me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.79,0:19:07.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Chinese is a bit rusty,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.49,0:19:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm having a hard time with\Nthe characters on the menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.21,0:19:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you help me decipher it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.27,0:19:13.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.63,0:19:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.03,0:19:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come now, Jotaro. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.09,0:19:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to be nice to the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.23,0:19:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been to Hong Kong\Nmany times over the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.09,0:19:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can at least read the\Ncharacters on the menus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.81,0:19:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.43,0:19:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what do you want to order?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.97,0:19:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dish with shrimp, duck,\Nshark fin, and mushrooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.65,0:19:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have this, this, and this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.01,0:19:41.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And might as well get some of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.21,0:19:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and this.
