Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.35,0:19:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed, this is quite\Ndifferent from our order!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.75,0:19:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew this would happen, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.31,0:20:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it makes no difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.05,0:20:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all on me, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.57,0:20:04.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, it doesn't matter what you order.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.71,0:20:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.81,0:20:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone, dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.71,0:20:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.62,0:20:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is you see that and you were
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.21,0:20:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,worried well they've certainly taken a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.43,0:20:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of time to prepare this it's almost\Nartistic take these carrots for example
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.97,0:20:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cut into perfect little stars in\Nfact it reminds me of something
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.39,0:20:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember now. Someone I know\Nhas a mark, a birthmark, just
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.29,0:20:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like this on the back of their\Nneck Know anyone like that?
