Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.89,0:21:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were right, another stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.75,0:21:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, he has such speed with his sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.37,0:21:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand is the chariot card,\Nand his name is Silver Chariot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.95,0:21:43.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mohamed Avdol, it seems that I\Nwill be disposing of you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.67,0:21:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've carved a burning\Nclock into that table.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.17,0:21:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before that clock strikes\Ntwelve, you will be a dead man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.83,0:22:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.28,0:22:14.66,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.59,0:22:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don't you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.66,0:22:16.96,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don'tcha know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.63,0:22:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you move too quick, oh-way-oh!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.96,0:22:18.42,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,If they move too quick
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.15,0:22:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.21,0:22:21.67,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.29,0:22:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the buzzer men by the Nile.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.67,0:22:24.00,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the bazaar men by the Nile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.95,0:22:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got the money on a bet.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.00,0:22:26.34,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They got the money on a bet
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.01,0:22:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Called crocodiles.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.34,0:22:27.84,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Gold crocodiles
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.61,0:22:30.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.51,0:22:30.97,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.57,0:22:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Falling tight to the hookah. I say.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.97,0:22:33.18,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Foreign types with their hookah pipes say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.87,0:22:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.85,0:22:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.19,0:22:42.73,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.95,0:22:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.59,0:22:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.12,0:22:56.58,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.57,0:22:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spin around and they cross the floor.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.58,0:22:58.96,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They spin around and they cross the floor
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.59,0:23:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.96,0:23:00.21,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They got the moves
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.09,0:23:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink then\Nthey bring you more.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.25,0:23:03.59,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink then they bring you more
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.25,0:23:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the school kids so sick of books.
